# onnxruntime-node (via @huggingface/transformers) tries to download its
# CUDA/GPU binary during install; Microsoft no longer publishes that asset
# for v1.21.0 (404), which fails npm ci outright. Skip the CUDA download:
# ONNX Runtime still installs and works on CPU, which is what CI and the
# release pipeline need. Vendor-documented switch, set by its install log.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
